  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PUBLIC AND PRIVATE INVESTMENT IN SUSTAINABLE GREEN CITIES, GREEN SPACES AND URBAN AGRICULTURE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the readiness proposal is to prepare the urban and peri-urban communities of Eswatini to build a better and more sustainable future for cities and their residents. The project achieves this by identifying, prioritizing and connecting cities? environmental challenges with sustainable infrastructure investments and policy measures, awareness and capacity building.</narrative>
